%% Underground Bunker. Theme: command bunker. Locks: BADGE, POWER, BLAST (the final door opens when two reactors' worth of power is on: power from the generator, reached through the air handling). Loop: a duct air handling<->armory.
%% start: E
%% goal: Cc
flowchart TD
  E["Bunker Door {start}"] --> Hl["Corridor Junction: the hub"]
  Hl --> Bk["Barracks {item:badge}"]
  Hl -->|req:badge| Ah["Air Handling {item:fuse}"]
  Ah --> Gn["Generator Hall"]
  Gn -->|req:fuse| Sw["Generator switch {item:power}"]
  Hl -->|req:power| Ar["Armory"]
  Ar --> Cc["Command Centre {goal}"]
  Ah -->|hole| Ar
